        "text": "### **Candidate [3]: Physical AI chip startup SiMa.ai raised a $150M Series C led by Fidelity and Amplify at a $1.45B valuation**\n* **What is confirmed:** On 2026-09-28, San Jose-based chipmaker SiMa.ai announced a $150 million Series C round co-led by Fidelity Management & Research Company and Amplify Partners"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 425,
        "endIndex": 470,
        "text": "The round values the startup at $1.45 billion"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 472,
        "endIndex": 621,
        "text": "Additional participants include Alter Venture Partners, Dell Technologies Capital, StepStone Group, J.P. Morgan, Baron Capital, and AllianceBernstein"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 623,
        "endIndex": 781,
        "text": "The capital will fund its software-centric Machine Learning System-on-Chip (MLSoC) development for physical AI (robotics, drones, and automotive edge devices)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0,
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 783,
        "endIndex": 904,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** While SiMa.ai targets physical AI and edge inference competing with Nvidia's CUDA-based hardware"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1057,
        "endIndex": 1279,
        "text": "### **Candidate [4]: Quartermaster raised a $140M Series B, with $100M in equity**\n* **What is confirmed:** Arlington, Virginia-based maritime awareness startup Quartermaster announced a $140 million Series B funding round"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1281,
        "endIndex": 1361,
        "text": "The funding comprises $100 million in equity financing alongside debt facilities"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        3,
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1363,
        "endIndex": 1410,
        "text": "This follows a $43 million Series A in May 2026"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1412,
        "endIndex": 1564,
        "text": "Quartermaster builds \"SmartMast,\" a weather-hardened onboard sensor suite and edge-computing node that streams real-time ocean and shipping intelligence"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1758,
        "endIndex": 1966,
        "text": "### **Candidate [5]: SpaceX's Starship launching to orbit for first time ever today**\n* **What is confirmed:** SpaceX launched Starship Flight 14 from Starbase, Texas, on 2026-09-28 at 8:50 AM EDT (12:50 UTC)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
