        "endIndex": 2085,
        "text": "The vehicle successfully reached an orbital trajectory (~275 km altitude) for the first time in the program's history"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        7,
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2087,
        "endIndex": 2256,
        "text": "Flight 14 is carrying a payload of 26 next-generation Starlink V3 satellites and is targeted for a 10-hour, six-orbit test mission ending with a Pacific Ocean splashdown"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        7,
        5
      ]
    },
    {
