    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 4199,
        "endIndex": 4500,
        "text": "### **Candidate [9]: Mark Zuckerberg unveils Meta Enterprise Platform led by MongoDB CEO Chirantan Desai**\n* **What is confirmed:** On 2026-09-28, Meta CEO Mark Zuckerberg unveiled the \"Meta Enterprise Platform,\" describing it as a key pillar for offering business AI tools and enterprise monetization"
