    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 5652,
        "endIndex": 5946,
        "text": "### **Candidate [16]: Nvidia releases AI safety software it says could have stopped Hugging Face hack**\n* **What is confirmed:** On 2026-09-28, Nvidia launched a suite of agentic security tools, including \"OpenShell\" (CPU hardware-level containerization) and \"Sentry\" (a secondary chip monitor)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
