      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 6464,
        "endIndex": 6727,
        "text": "### **Candidate [17]: Trump rejects AI regulation while Bill Gates warns of risks**\n* **What is confirmed:** US President Trump reiterated his stance rejecting sweeping statutory AI safety guardrails, arguing regulations would hinder US progress relative to China"
